{"3641000":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Incident at Galley House","steam_appid":3641000,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Sunday the 7th of March, 1936, a group of locals made their way up the long, muddy track to Galley House. As far as any of them knew, the house had stood empty for decades. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, they discovered the bloody aftermath of something horrific. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The authorities were summoned, and the crime scene was eventually cleared away. But nobody ever figured out what happened that dreadful night. It seemed likely that no one ever would.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, many years later, you have access to a peculiar machine — one that lets you listen in on echoes of the past. Can <i>you<\/i> piece together the events behind <i>The Incident at Galley House<\/i>? <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/extras\/3933673fba0690ccea9fb6e44d049273.poster.avif?t=1784666918\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/extras\/3933673fba0690ccea9fb6e44d049273.mp4?t=1784666918\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Chilling Detective Game, Reimagined on Steam<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Incident at Galley House <\/i>is based on the acclaimed text-based browser game <i>Type Help<\/i>, remastered for Steam by the creators of <i>The Roottrees Are Dead<\/i>. It's the same haunting game of deduction, now with many enhancements:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-new, fully illustrated visual novel presentation<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full professional voice acting<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious 3D interface for navigating memories<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie original soundtrack<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New content and puzzles to explore<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/extras\/48b9c74f9177659bdca9beafee52767e.avif?t=1784666918\" width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Sunday the 7th of March, 1936, a group of locals made their way up the long, muddy track to Galley House. As far as any of them knew, the house had stood empty for decades. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, they discovered the bloody aftermath of something horrific. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The authorities were summoned, and the crime scene was eventually cleared away. But nobody ever figured out what happened that dreadful night. It seemed likely that no one ever would.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, many years later, you have access to a peculiar machine — one that lets you listen in on echoes of the past. Can <i>you<\/i> piece together the events behind <i>The Incident at Galley House<\/i>? <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/extras\/3933673fba0690ccea9fb6e44d049273.poster.avif?t=1784666918\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/extras\/3933673fba0690ccea9fb6e44d049273.mp4?t=1784666918\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Chilling Detective Game, Reimagined on Steam<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Incident at Galley House <\/i>is based on the acclaimed text-based browser game <i>Type Help<\/i>, remastered for Steam by the creators of <i>The Roottrees Are Dead<\/i>. It's the same haunting game of deduction, now with many enhancements:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-new, fully illustrated visual novel presentation<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full professional voice acting<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious 3D interface for navigating memories<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie original soundtrack<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New content and puzzles to explore<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/extras\/48b9c74f9177659bdca9beafee52767e.avif?t=1784666918\" width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"In 1936, something terrible happened at Galley House. Decades later, with a strange contraption that reveals echoes of the past, you must uncover the truth behind this grisly mystery.","supported_languages":"영어<strong>*<\/strong>, 프랑스어, 독일어, 일본어, 중국어 간체<br><strong>*<\/strong>음성이 지원되는 언어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/c36fe32e992c59c8eb560fd5d97bed0f96c08ff5\/header.jpg?t=1784666918","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/538c5b58f09f992d6f2906bf4f56c577cb9e2978\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784666918","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3641000\/538c5b58f09f992d6f2906bf4f56c577cb9e2978\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784666918","website":"https:\/\/galley.house","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<b